/*
  Just To Study — App.jsx
  Corrected version:
  - Frontend never calls Anthropic/OpenRouter directly.
  - Frontend sends JSON to /api/tutor with Content-Type only.
  - No API prompt/detected topic/detected interest shown to student.
  - Tutor explains naturally, gives examples, then asks if user wants a quiz.
  - If yes: asks 5 questions one by one.
  - If no: asks what user wants to learn next.
  - Local fallback works if backend/API returns unsupported media type or any error.
*/

